macOS now has 12 development-ready tasks from release identity through authenticated stable assets and rollback rehearsal. I’m creating the iOS chain next, with signed-payload reproducibility described honestly: deterministic unsigned inputs plus traceable signed outputs, not an invalid byte-for-byte IPA promise.
