e; Apple signed outputs use reproducible unsigned inputs plus exact signed provenance. Regional VPN licensing, current Apple guidance, public privacy/export declarations, release credentials, and review fixture are explicit blocking tasks. Board validation and canonical plan pass. Graphviz PNG rendering is currently unavailable because dot cannot load libltdl.7.dylib; authoritative DOT/PlantUML sources are attached. No implementation or source/specification edit was performed."}}]

