he distributed DMG is notarized, stapled, accepted by Gatekeeper on a clean supported Apple-silicon Mac, and accompanied by verified checksums, SBOM or notice links, source and relay provenance, and version metadata. 4. Private-repository publication exposes immutable versioned assets plus the stable ReluxProxy.dmg name through authenticated GitHub access, updates the stable asset without a partial window, and proves unauthenticated access is not assumed. 5. Clean install, upgrade from the supported legacy release, approved coexistence or migration, extension approval, connect or disconnect smoke, uninstall, previous-version rollback, bad-release withdrawal, and credential revocation are reproducible. 6. Production credentials are environment-scoped, masked, rotation-tested, absent from forks and retained artifacts, and release jobs are serialized with an auditable evidence bundle.","assignee":"","blockedBy":["STORY-260715-n5dt84","STORY-260715-309t4z","STORY-260715-2itwz7","STORY-260715-2xnj3v","STORY-260715-l2i2oo","STORY-260715-anxje6","STORY-260715-19mjyn"],"blocks":["STORY-260715-2dtdql"],"checklist":[],"children":["TASK-260715-1gzhnk","TASK-260715-1njthi","TASK-260715-1r48pc","TASK-260715-1tzaed","TASK-260715-2aessv","TASK-260715-30lksy","TASK-260715-387eof","TASK-260715-3gkwn0","TASK-260715-3s6yds","TASK-260715-3sk5cd","TASK-260715-go37ij","TASK-260715-yynqbr"],"created":"2026-07-15T00:47:17Z","description":"Deliver a protected macOS release path for ReluxProxyMac and its packet-tunnel extension, including archive assembly, minimum entitlements, nested signing, hardened runtime, notarization, stapling, Gatekeeper validation, DMG publication, stable authenticated assets, migration checks, and rollback.","id":"STORY-260715-c1qsc6","isBlocked":true,"name":"macos-signed-distribution","notes":"","outcomeResources":[],"parent":"EPIC-260715-w5gzf4","preconditionResources":[],"scope":"In scope: release signing contract, Developer ID credentials and least-privilege ow